WEBVTT

0
00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:04.460
Sprezzature is an AI engine for Design.

1
00:00:04.660 --> 00:00:06.860
This one is about accessibility.

2
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:11.312
A blind reader visits
your page with a screen reader.

3
00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:16.600
On this portrait,
all she hears is one word: image.

4
00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:23.439
Or a video starts on its own, with sound.

5
00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:28.525
Now she cannot hear the screen reader
that would help her stop it.

6
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:36.760
The suite reads your page
and checks 20 rules.

7
00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:41.120
It can repair 6 of them by itself, safely.

8
00:00:45.400 --> 00:00:49.525
And the missing descriptions?
A model on your machine writes them.

9
00:00:50.600 --> 00:00:54.000
It looks at the image,
and reads the page around it.

10
00:01:00.400 --> 00:01:03.519
It is a first draft. You stay the editor.

11
00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:11.200
Star it on GitHub,
and find the suite on sprezzature.ai.

12
00:01:11.600 --> 00:01:14.360
Make it, audit it, take a look at it.
